DQL Query for Application Crashes
fetch logs
| filter event.type == "app_crash"
| fields timestamp, host.name, service.name, content
| sort timestamp asc
Crash Pattern Finding
order-service experienced three different application failure patterns on the same Kubernetes worker node:

Database connection pool exhaustion.
Null pointer exception during order payload validation.
JVM Metaspace exhaustion.
Because all three application crashes occur on k8s-worker-node-02, investigation should prioritize the order-service workload and resources running on that worker.

